    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d678-a6">

                <pb facs="0919" n="849" sameAs="frus:frus1862/pg849"/>

                <head>F.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Note sent to His
                            Imperial Highness Prince Kung</hi>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1862-07-22"><hi rendition="#italic">July 22,</hi>
                        1862</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I arrived at the capital on the 20th instant, and am at present temporarily
                    stopping at the legation of France. When the various duties incident on arrival
                    are attended to, it will be proper to present the President’s letter to his
                    Majesty. At your highness’s leisure, please appoint a day when I can in person
                    assure you of my sincere regard; and, meanwhile, I avail myself of this
                    opportunity to respectfully wish you the enjoyment of every happiness.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ANSON BURLINGAME.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
